<mxCell id="t1" value="&lt;b&gt;[Task 1] setup_dates&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;INPUT: UTC Now (auto) | DAG Params (manual override)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;PROSES:&lt;br/&gt;- Hitung Library date range -&gt; epoch Unix (harian)&lt;br/&gt;  Auto: kemarin 00:00:00 - 23:59:59 UTC&lt;br/&gt;- Hitung Hashtag date range -&gt; YYYYMMDD-YYYYMMDD (mingguan)&lt;br/&gt;  Auto: Senin-Minggu minggu lalu (7 hari)&lt;br/&gt;- Hitung Selling date range -&gt; YYYYMMDD-YYYYMMDD (bulanan)&lt;br/&gt;  Auto: bulan lalu hari pertama hingga terakhir&lt;br/&gt;- Generate run_id (YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS) dan file_suffix&lt;br/&gt;- Kirim notifikasi Discord: Pipeline Started&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;OUTPUT (XCom): dates {library_start/end_epoch,&lt;br/&gt;  hashtag_time_range, selling_time_range, run_id, file_suffix}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="180" width="560" height="195" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t2" value="&lt;b&gt;[Task 2] validate_credentials&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;INPUT: Airflow Variable ECHOTIK_BEARER_TOKEN, ECHOTIK_COOKIES&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;PROSES:&lt;br/&gt;- Variable.get(ECHOTIK_BEARER_TOKEN) - wajib ada&lt;br/&gt;- Validasi: token tidak kosong dan bukan placeholder&lt;br/&gt;- Variable.get(ECHOTIK_COOKIES) - opsional, default empty&lt;br/&gt;- Log panjang karakter token dan cookies&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;OUTPUT (XCom): {status: valid, has_bearer: True, has_cookies: bool}&lt;br/&gt;ERROR: raise AirflowException jika token tidak di-set" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="390" width="560" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t3" value="&lt;b&gt;[Task 3] fetch_video_library  [trigger_rule=all_done]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;INPUT: XCom dates | PAGINATION_CONFIG | Airflow Variables&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;PROSES:&lt;br/&gt;- Cek skip flag (library_start_date == skip)&lt;br/&gt;- Build EchotikAPIClient(bearer_token, regional_headers, timeout=30s)&lt;br/&gt;- Fetch: GET /api/v1/data/videos&lt;br/&gt;  ?page={n}&amp;per_page=30&amp;start_time={epoch}&amp;end_time={epoch}&amp;sort=desc&amp;order=views_count&lt;br/&gt;- Paginasi: halaman 1-14, berhenti jika records &lt; 30&lt;br/&gt;- Throttle: 3-10 dtk antar halaman | 30-60 dtk antar API&lt;br/&gt;- Simpan: /opt/airflow/raw-data/json/video_library_{date}.json&lt;br/&gt;- Kirim Discord: Category Summary&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;OUTPUT (XCom): {records_count, filepath, status: success|skipped|failed}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="540" width="560" height="195" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t4" value="&lt;b&gt;[Task 4] fetch_hashtags  [trigger_rule=all_done]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;INPUT: XCom dates | PAGINATION_CONFIG | Airflow Variables&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;PROSES:&lt;br/&gt;- Cek skip flag (hashtag_time_range == skip)&lt;br/&gt;- Build EchotikAPIClient(bearer_token, regional_headers, timeout=30s)&lt;br/&gt;- Fetch: GET /api/v1/data/tags/leaderboard/top-hashtag&lt;br/&gt;  ?time_type=weekly&amp;time_range={YYYYMMDD-YYYYMMDD}&amp;page={n}&amp;per_page=30&lt;br/&gt;- Paginasi: halaman 1-14 | Throttle antar API: 30-60 dtk&lt;br/&gt;- Simpan: /opt/airflow/raw-data/json/hashtags_{range}.json&lt;br/&gt;- Kirim Discord: Category Summary&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;OUTPUT (XCom): {records_count, filepath, status}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="750" width="560" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t5" value="&lt;b&gt;[Task 5] fetch_video_selling  [trigger_rule=all_done]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;INPUT: XCom dates | PAGINATION_CONFIG | Airflow Variables&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;PROSES:&lt;br/&gt;- Cek skip flag (selling_time_range == skip)&lt;br/&gt;- Build EchotikAPIClient(bearer_token, regional_headers, timeout=30s)&lt;br/&gt;- Fetch: GET /api/v1/data/videos/leaderboard/sell-videos&lt;br/&gt;  ?time_type=monthly&amp;time_range={YYYYMMDD-YYYYMMDD}&amp;page={n}&amp;per_page=30&lt;br/&gt;- Paginasi: halaman 1-14 | Data GMV + produk TikTok Shop&lt;br/&gt;- Simpan: /opt/airflow/raw-data/json/video_selling_{range}.json&lt;br/&gt;- Kirim Discord: Category Summary&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;OUTPUT (XCom): {records_count, filepath, status}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="945" width="560" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t6" value="&lt;b&gt;[Task 6] parser_and_validate  [trigger_rule=all_done]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;INPUT: filepath XCom (task3,4,5) | EXCEL_OUTPUT_PATH&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;PROSES - Video Library:&lt;br/&gt;- parse_video_library_record() - konversi angka, pct, durasi, datetime&lt;br/&gt;- Computed: viral_score, engagement_tier, duration_bucket&lt;br/&gt;- Ekstrak: hashtag_count, mention_count, emoji_count, has_question&lt;br/&gt;- validate_video_record() - required fields + business rules&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;PROSES - Hashtag Library:&lt;br/&gt;- parse_hashtag_record() - avg_views_per_video, competition_level&lt;br/&gt;- validate_hashtag_record()&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;PROSES - Video Selling:&lt;br/&gt;- parse_video_selling_record() - GMV (IDR+USD), products, revenue_tier&lt;br/&gt;- validate_video_record()&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;SEMUA DATA:&lt;br/&gt;- deduplicate_records() per tipe (key: echotik_video_id / echotik_tag_id)&lt;br/&gt;- get_validation_summary() - {total, valid, invalid, error_breakdown}&lt;br/&gt;- export_to_excel() - echotik_data_{suffix}.xlsx&lt;br/&gt;  Sheets: video_library | hashtags | video_selling | validation_report&lt;br/&gt;- Kirim Discord: Parser dan Validation Summary&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;OUTPUT (XCom): {excel_path, total_records, valid_records, invalid_records}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="1140" width="560" height="310" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t7" value="&lt;b&gt;[Task 7] dag_complete_summary  [trigger_rule=all_done]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;INPUT: XCom dari parser_and_validate + setup_dates&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;PROSES:&lt;br/&gt;- Hitung durasi total: utcnow() - dag_run.start_date&lt;br/&gt;- Tentukan status: total_records &gt; 0 = success, else = partial&lt;br/&gt;- Hitung next_run = utcnow() + 90 menit&lt;br/&gt;- Kirim Discord: Final DAG Summary&lt;br/&gt;  (status, durasi, total records, next run time)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;OUTPUT (XCom): {status: success|partial, total_records: int}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="1465" width="560" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
