<mxCell id="c1" value="&lt;b&gt;_build_headers(referer_path)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- Random User-Agent (3 Chrome)&lt;br/&gt;- Authorization: Bearer {token}&lt;br/&gt;- Accept: application/json&lt;br/&gt;- Content-Type: application/json&lt;br/&gt;- x-region, x-currency, x-lang,&lt;br/&gt;  x-secondary-currency&lt;br/&gt;- Sec-Ch-Ua (browser fingerprint)&lt;br/&gt;- Referer: BASE_URL+referer_path&lt;br/&gt;- Cookie: {cookies} [opsional]&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Return: Dict[str, str] headers" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1762" width="300" height="220" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;b&gt;fetch_with_retry(url, page_num)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Loop max 3 kali:&lt;br/&gt;  1. _build_headers(referer_path)&lt;br/&gt;  2. session.GET(url, timeout=30s)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  HTTP 429 (Rate Limit):&lt;br/&gt;    sleep(Retry-After)&lt;br/&gt;    Discord: rate_limit_alert&lt;br/&gt;    continue retry&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  HTTP 401/403 (Auth Error):&lt;br/&gt;    raise Exception&lt;br/&gt;    (token expired, update manual)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  Timeout:&lt;br/&gt;    sleep(10 * attempt detik)&lt;br/&gt;    continue retry&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Semua retry habis -&gt; return None" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="375" y="1762" width="330" height="220" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;b&gt;_paginate_fetch(url_builder, start=1, end=14)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Loop page 1 hingga 14:&lt;br/&gt;  1. url = url_builder(page)&lt;br/&gt;  2. response = fetch_with_retry(url)&lt;br/&gt;  3. records = _extract_records(response)&lt;br/&gt;  4. all_records.extend(records)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  Last page detection:&lt;br/&gt;  len(records) &lt; per_page -&gt; break&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  Response None/kosong:&lt;br/&gt;  skip halaman, lanjut berikutnya&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  Throttle: sleep(random 3-10 dtk)&lt;br/&gt;  (kecuali halaman terakhir)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Return: List[Dict] semua records" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="1762" width="370" height="220" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;_extract_records(response)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- response = list&lt;br/&gt;  -&gt; return langsung&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- response = dict:&lt;br/&gt;  Cek key: data, items,&lt;br/&gt;  results, records, list&lt;br/&gt;  -&gt; return response[key]&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- Nested (response[data] = dict):&lt;br/&gt;  Cek key: items, list,&lt;br/&gt;  records, data&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- Tidak ditemukan -&gt; return []" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1105" y="1762" width="285" height="220" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
